# This project is pnpm-only. Do not use npm or yarn.
#
# Enforcement lives in package.json:
#   - "preinstall": "npx --yes only-allow pnpm"  -> blocks npm/yarn installs
#   - "packageManager": "pnpm@..."               -> pins the pnpm version
#
# Intentionally minimal: no engine-strict (some transitive deps exclude
# non-LTS Node builds like v23.x, which would make pnpm itself refuse to
# install). pnpm 9 defaults (auto-install-peers, etc.) are what we want.
